REFERENCE   5  (bases 1 to 2300)
  AUTHORS   Zheng,A., Zhang,L., Song,X., Wang,Y., Wei,M. and Jin,F.
  TITLE     Clinical implications of a novel prognostic factor AIFM3 in breast
            cancer patients
  JOURNAL   BMC Cancer 19 (1), 451 (2019)
   PUBMED   31088422
  REMARK    GeneRIF: AIFM3 was significantly more expressed in breast cancer
            tissues than in normal tissues. There was a significant association
            of AIFM3 expression with tumor size, lymph node metastasis,
            molecular typing and TNM staging. Lymph node metastasis and TNM
            stage were independent factors of AIFM3 expression. High AIFM3
            expression was related to a shorter OS and DFS.
